course: dictionary
lesson: 9954
title: Tatar: a people, a language, a word for things
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Tatar with a capital letter is the name of a people. A Tatar is a member of a Turkic people who live mainly in Tatarstan in Russia, and also in Crimea and other countries. The word can also name a language, and as an adjective it describes things that belong to these people, their language or their culture.
explain: Clues help you work out which meaning is meant. The capital letter tells you it is a name. «Crimean Tatars are the native people of Crimea in Ukraine.» Native means the people who first lived there, so the sentence tells you where a Tatar group has its roots.
explain: Some history is sad. «In May 1944 Stalin's regime deported the whole Crimean Tatar people to Central Asia.» Deported means forced to leave your home and sent away. Many people died on the way, and Ukraine recognises this as genocide.
explain: Tatar also appears in food words. «Steak tartare» and «tartar sauce» come from an old spelling of the name. These words are not about the people, so the sentence around them tells you which meaning to choose.
fact: Tatar with a capital T names a people, who have a long history in Eastern Europe and Central Asia.
fact: Most Tatars live in Tatarstan, which is in Russia.
fact: Crimean Tatars are the native people of Crimea, which is in Ukraine.
fact: «Deported» means forced to leave your home and sent away.
fact: Tatar can name a language, and as an adjective it describes things that belong to the people, their language or their culture.
exercise: «Crimean Tatars are the native people of Crimea.» What does native mean here? | People who love to travel | *The first people who lived there | Visitors from another country | People who come from the sea
exercise: In which country is Crimea? | Russia | *Ukraine | Poland | Turkey
exercise: What does a capital letter tell you about the word Tatar? | It is a verb for running | It means it is at the start of a sentence only | It is a type of food | *It is the name of a people
test: «The Tatar language has its own sounds and words.» What is Tatar in this sentence? | A people | A food | A town | *A language
test: «Many Tatars live in Tatarstan, in Russia.» Where is Tatarstan? | Poland | *Russia | Central Asia only | Ukraine
exam: The word «Tatar» with a capital T is a | *name of a people | colour | kind of sauce | way of cooking
